+    // waitRequested() is a CRT getenv (locked environment scan). Profiled
+    // 2026-10-18 as ~21% of the room's guest thread with resident mode off.
+    // Both tests are pure, so the order does not change behaviour.
+    const uint32_t physical=address&0x1fffffffu;
